    <unit id="ba7239ba-679f-4c51-aa1e-4092c9235681">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 6</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>This add-on is maintained and improved in loving memory of Rui Fontes, who passed away on 11 July 2026.</source>
        <target>本插件的维护和改进是为了纪念于 2026 年 7 月 11 日去世的 Rui Fontes。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="d24a2ea5-db32-4b74-bc34-2ce94f370dd1">
      <notes>
        <note appliesTo="source">line: 8</note>
      </notes>
      <segment state="final">
        <source>Rui devoted much of his life to making technology accessible to blind and visually impaired people, and his generosity, skill, and dedication touched countless users and fellow developers in the NVDA community. This project is carried forward in his honour, and with heartfelt gratitude for everything he gave. May his work keep opening doors for those who need it.</source>
        <target>Rui 将一生中的大量时光奉献给了让盲人和低视力人士能够使用技术的事业，他的慷慨、才华与奉献精神感动了 NVDA 社区中无数用户和开发者同仁。本项目为纪念他而继续推进，并对他所付出的一切致以由衷的感谢。愿他的工作继续为有需要的人打开一扇扇大门。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
